        {
          "text": "Mpawo Davida wakajata zyakusama zyakwe, wakazideluula, abalo bantu boonse mbaakali abo bakacita mbubonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bakoomoka akulila akuliimya zilyo mane kusikila kumabbililo aazuba, nkaambo ka-Saulo a-Jonatani mwanaakwe abantu boonse ba-Jehova aluzubo lwa-Israyeli nkaambo bakajayigwa kupanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Davida wakabuzya oyo mulombe iwakamulwiida kuti, Ino uzwa kuli? Wakati, Ndi mwana wamuzwakule, mu-Amaleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
